---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Reveal from '../components/Reveal.astro';
import { buildBreadcrumbSchema } from '../lib/schemas';

const title = "Terms of service | Keith's K9 Care";
const description = `The simple terms that apply when you book a groom with Keith's K9 Care. Hall Green, Wakefield ${site.address.postcode}.`;

const breadcrumbSchema = buildBreadcrumbSchema([
  { name: "Home", url: `${site.url}/` },
  { name: "Terms", url: `${site.url}/terms/` },
]);

const lastUpdated = "2026-05-28";
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} noindex={true}>
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />

  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Terms"
    heading="Booking, pricing, and what to expect."
    body={`Friendly plain-English terms covering bookings, cancellations and welfare. Last updated ${lastUpdated}.`}
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-tight prose max-w-2xl">
      <Reveal class="space-y-6 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold text-ink-900 mt-0">Who you're booking with</h2>
          <p>You're booking a dog grooming service with <strong>Keith's K9 Care</strong>, operated by Keith Kershaw at {site.address.street}, {site.address.locality}, {site.address.region} {site.address.postcode}. Keith is iPET Network qualified and fully insured.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold text-ink-900">Pricing</h2>
          <p>Prices listed on this website are <strong>starting prices</strong>. The final price for your dog's groom may vary depending on coat condition, size, behaviour, and how long it's been since their last groom. Keith will always confirm the price with you in person before starting the appointment.</p>
          <p>Surcharges are listed on the <a href="/pricing/" class="text-teal-700 font-semibold">pricing page</a> — matted coats, anxious dogs, extra-large coats and so on. Nothing is a surprise on the bill.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold text-ink-900">Booking & cancellation</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-6 marker:text-coral-500">
            <li>Booking is confirmed when Keith confirms the time slot with you by phone, WhatsApp or email.</li>
            <li>If you need to cancel or reschedule, please give us <strong>at least 24 hours' notice</strong>. We're a single-groomer salon and a missed slot is one we can't fill.</li>
            <li>Repeated no-shows or very last-minute cancellations may mean we ask for a small holding deposit on future bookings.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold text-ink-900">Your dog's welfare</h2>
          <p>This one matters most.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-6 marker:text-coral-500">
            <li>If your dog becomes too distressed during a groom for the work to safely continue, we'll stop, look after them, and call you. We'll always charge for the time taken honestly — never for a full session we couldn't complete.</li>
            <li>If your dog's coat is so matted that brushing it out would be painful or unsafe, the kindest option is a fresh start with a clip-down. Keith will always discuss this with you in person <em>before</em> picking up the clippers.</li>
            <li>If we spot something during the groom that suggests a vet visit (skin condition, ear infection, lumps), we'll tell you. We're groomers, not vets, so we'll always defer to your vet for a diagnosis.</li>
            <li>Please be honest about your dog's vaccination status, any bites/aggression history, and any medical conditions when you book. We can almost always help — but we need to know.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold text-ink-900">Payment</h2>
          <p>Payment is taken at the end of the appointment by cash, card or bank transfer. We don't take card payments through this website. If your bank requires it, we'll provide a written receipt.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold text-ink-900">Photos & reviews</h2>
          <p>We love a photo of your dog looking smart. We'll always ask before posting anything featuring your dog (with name or breed) on this website or on social media — usually a quick "okay if we share this?" by message. You can always change your mind later and we'll take it down.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold text-ink-900">Complaints</h2>
          <p>If anything's not right, please tell Keith straight away — most of the time we can put it right on the spot or at your next visit. Drop us a line at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="text-teal-700 font-semibold">{site.email}</a>, call on <a href={`tel:${site.phoneIntl}`} class="text-teal-700 font-semibold">{site.phone}</a>, or message Keith on WhatsApp.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold text-ink-900">Privacy</h2>
          <p>What we collect about you and what we do with it is covered on our <a href="/privacy/" class="text-teal-700 font-semibold">Privacy policy</a> page.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold text-ink-900">Law</h2>
          <p>These terms are governed by the law of England and Wales.</p>
        </div>

      </Reveal>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
